## Interface: 11200
## Title: ScaledLifeTap
## Author: Kimilly (original), OEVG2 (4.0)
## Version: 4.0
## Notes: Casts the highest Life Tap rank that fits your missing mana, using exact spell damage from ClassicAPI or Nampower when available, otherwise its own gear scanner.
## Notes-deDE: Wirkt den passenden Aderlass-Rang abhaengig von fehlendem Mana, Zauberschaden und Talenten. Benoetigt kein BonusScanner mehr.
## DefaultState: Enabled
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: SLT_Config
Locale.lua
Scanner.lua
ScaledLifeTap.lua
